  "body": "This is a proposal to replace [Bundlesize](https://github.com/siddharthkp/bundlesize) by [Size Limit](https://github.com/ai/size-limit) in our tooling to track bundle size increases/decreases.\r\n\r\n## Output\r\n\r\n[See CI output →](https://circleci.com/gh/algolia/instantsearch.js/2691)\r\n\r\n### Success\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ size-limit\r\n\r\n  UMD\r\n  Size limit:   80 KB\r\n  Package size: 77.89 KB with all dependencies, minified and gzipped\r\n  Loading time: 1.6 s    on slow 3G\r\n  Running time: 932 ms   on Snapdragon 410\r\n  Total time:   2.5 s\r\n\r\n  CJS\r\n  Size limit:   100 KB\r\n  Package size: 91.56 KB with all dependencies, minified and gzipped\r\n  Loading time: 1.9 s    on slow 3G\r\n  Running time: 1.7 s    on Snapdragon 410\r\n  Total time:   3.5 s\r\n\r\n  ESM\r\n  Size limit:   100 KB\r\n  Package size: 90.11 KB with all dependencies, minified and gzipped\r\n  Loading time: 1.9 s    on slow 3G\r\n  Running time: 1.3 s    on Snapdragon 410\r\n  Total time:   3.1 s\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Failed\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ size-limit\r\n\r\n  UMD\r\n  Package size limit has exceeded by 7.89 KB\r\n  Size limit:   70 KB\r\n  Package size: 77.89 KB with all dependencies, minified and gzipped\r\n  Loading time: 1.6 s    on slow 3G\r\n  Running time: 772 ms   on Snapdragon 410\r\n  Total time:   2.4 s\r\n\r\n  CJS\r\n  Size limit:   100 KB\r\n  Package size: 91.56 KB with all dependencies, minified and gzipped\r\n  Loading time: 1.9 s    on slow 3G\r\n  Running time: 1.5 s    on Snapdragon 410\r\n  Total time:   3.3 s\r\n\r\n  ESM\r\n  Size limit:   100 KB\r\n  Package size: 90.11 KB with all dependencies, minified and gzipped\r\n  Loading time: 1.9 s    on slow 3G\r\n  Running time: 1.2 s    on Snapdragon 410\r\n  Total time:   3 s\r\n\r\n  Try to reduce size or increase limit in .size-limit.js\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Comparison with Bundlesize\r\n\r\n### Pros\r\n\r\n- Works for UMD, CJS and ESM bundles\r\n- Shows loading time\r\n- Shows running time\r\n\r\n### Cons\r\n\r\n- No complete GitHub integrations with reports in checks\r\n- Not able to compare with base branch\r\n\r\nThe major downside that I see is that it doesn't compare the current branch bundle size with the base branch. However, Bundlesize worked only based on `master`, which was meaningless for us.\r\n\r\nTherefore I think this tool brings more value than Bundlesize for now. Let me know what you think!",
